# TMC2209 stepper-driver channel (proven on boards/pico_tmc2209/).
# use lib/tmc2209.ocd, then: instance tmc2209 as Z1 join VM GND V3V3
# STEP/DIR/EN/SGND stay private per instance (Z1_STEP, ...); join them up top.
board tmc2209 10x10
block tmc2209 ports VM GND V3V3
part U QFN28
part Cv C0805 100nF
part Ccp C0805 22nF
part Ra R1206 0.11
part Rb R1206 0.11
part J PINHD4
net VM: U.22 Cv.1
net GND: U.3 Cv.2
net CPO: U.4 Ccp.1
net CPI: U.5 Ccp.2
net OA: U.24 Ra.1 J.1
net OA2: U.25 J.2
net OB: U.26 Rb.1 J.3
net OB2: U.1 U.27 J.4
net SGND: Ra.2 Rb.2
net STEP: U.13
net DIR: U.19
net EN: U.2
net V3V3: U.15
net VM: U.22 U.28 Cv.1
end
